{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1375555-extra-health-levels-trinket","id":1375555,"title":"Extra Health Levels Trinket (?)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-19T00:23:46-07:00","id":1375555,"title":"Extra Health Levels Trinket (?)","content":"There's a rote of giving oneself extra health-levels; Prime 5 Life 3.<br /> Would it be possible to make a Trinket with such an effect, that essentially allows the holder to have those extra health levels?<br /> Or would it require a Talisman or something of that sorts? Since Trinkets are meant for very simple and linear effects, and well, this is supposedly a tad more complicated than that..?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-19T02:58:02-07:00","id":1375572,"title":"","content":"Trinkets are essentially faux-wonders. That is, the resulting object is magically changed, but it in itself is no wonder.<br /> See: Bulletproof hoodie made with the matter sphere. It's still the best example.<br /> <br /> So no, a Trinket can't do that - a charm could though, and technically it's already possible to give you extra health levels with Life 3 alone. So Prime 3, Life 3 would allow for making charms that temporarily give those extra levels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woda